The '''Mountain Loot Crate''' is a lootable container variant that spawns in the [[Mountain Forest]] biome of ''[[Human Host]]''.

== Contents ==

Contents scale to the biome tier. Common items include salvage, ammunition, and biome-appropriate resources.

== Location ==

Native biome: [[Mountain Forest]]

Asset bundle: <code>shc_crates_mountain</code>

